@startuml ComplaintStateDiagram
title Complaint state diagram
state "In Progress" as InProgress
skinparam dpi 300

[*] --> Open : submit (FR-06)
Open --> InProgress : accept by staff (FR-12)\nassign by supervisor (FR-17)
InProgress --> InProgress : reassign by supervisor (FR-17)
InProgress --> Resolved : resolve [assigned staff or supervisor] (FR-13)
Resolved --> Open : reopen [within 7 days, reason] (FR-10)
Open --> Rejected : reject [reason] (FR-20)
Open --> Rejected : reject [staff or supervisor, reason] (FR-20)
InProgress --> Rejected : reject [assigned staff or supervisor, reason] (FR-20)
Resolved --> [*] : after 7 days
Rejected --> [*]

note right of Open
  Overdue is a mark, not a state.
  Added after 48 hours (FR-15),
  removed on accept, assign or reject.
end note
@enduml